:"Languages"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__tidbit-data","text":"The languages it knew in life"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__tidbit-label","text":"Challenge"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__tidbit-data","text":"15 (13,000 XP)"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__tidbit-label","text":"Proficiency Bonus"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__tidbit-data","text":"+5"},{"element":"div","class":"mon-stat-block__description-block-heading","text":"Traits"},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Magic Resistance."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The mummy lord has advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Rejuvenation."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"A destroyed mummy lord gains a new body in 24 hours if its heart is intact, regaining all its hit points and becoming active again. The new body appears within 5 feet of the mummy lord's heart."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Spellcasting."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The mummy lord is a 10th-level spellcaster. Its spellcasting ability is Wisdom (spell save DC 17,"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"+9"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"to hit with spell attacks). The mummy lord has the following cleric spells prepared:"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"Cantrips (at will):"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover spell-tooltip","text":"sacred flame"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":","},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover spell-tooltip","text":"thaumaturgy"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"1st level (4 slots):"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover spell-tooltip","text":"command"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":","},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover spell-tooltip","text":"guiding bolt"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":","},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover spell-tooltip","text":"shield of faith"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"2nd level (3 slots):"},{"element":